  pass  removing the alternate's emitted field removes it from the contract
  pass  scenes without alternate versions retain their ordinary contract

test_the_renderer_cannot_read_a_sidecar_field_the_compiler_never_writes:
  pass  a field the compiler writes is read without complaint
